  "prefLabel": "Ncr 1106.03 Acquisition of Real Property",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 1106.03 Acquisition of Real Property. Pursuant to RSA 4:29, the department shall acquire real property by purchase or gift for the purpose of protecting species listed under Ncr 1108.01 and Ncr 1108.02.\n\nSource. #5927, eff 11-22-94, EXPIRED: 11-22-00\n\nNew. #7507, eff 6-21-01; ss by #9479, eff 6-1-09, EXPIRED: 6-1-17\n\nNew. #12825, INTERIM, eff 7-10-19, EXPIRES: 1-6-20",
